  #line-at(56.88pt, 455.52pt, "materials and face challenges when applied to micron-scale thin films. Moreover, these approaches ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 483.12pt, "often require multiple experimental configurations to extract different thermal parameters, increasing ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 510.72pt, "measurement complexity and introducing potential inconsistencies.  ")
  #line-at(74.88pt, 538.32pt, "To overcome these challenges, several methods tailored for thin film characterization have been ")
